#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:210
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your donation of {amount} to {organisation_name}.\n"
"\n"
"Reference: {reference}\n"
"Receipt number: {receipt_number}\n"
"\n"
"Your receipt is attached as a PDF. Keep it for your records.\n"
"\n"
"With gratitude,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:214
msgid "Thank you for your first donation to {organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:215
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for making your first donation to {organisation_name}. Your support means a great deal, and we are grateful to have you with us.\n"
"\n"
"We will keep you posted on the difference it makes.\n"
"\n"
"With gratitude,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:219
msgid "Payment instructions for your donation to {organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:220
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_name},\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for choosing to support {campaign_title} with a donation of {amount}.\n"
"\n"
"{instructions}\n"
"\n"
"Please transfer the amount using the reference {reference}. We will email your receipt as soon as the payment arrives.\n"
"\n"
"{bank_details}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:224
msgid "Your donation is processing"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:225
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"We have received your donation of {amount}.\n"
"\n"
"Reference: {reference}\n"
"\n"
"Your payment is being processed. Bank settlement can take a few business days; we will email your receipt the moment it clears.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:229
msgid "Your donation has been refunded"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:230
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_name},\n"
"\n"
"We have refunded your donation of {amount} to {campaign_title}. Funds should return to your card within 5 to 10 business days.\n"
"\n"
"If this was a mistake or you have any questions, just reply to this email.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:234
msgid "Your recurring donation renewed"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:235
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} was renewed today. Receipt number: {receipt_number}.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your continued support.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:239
msgid "Your donation couldn't be taken this month"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:240
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"We tried to collect your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} today and your bank declined it. This usually means a card has expired or been replaced.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing has been charged and your donation is still set up. You can update your card here:\n"
"{portal_url}\n"
"\n"
"If you would rather stop the donation, that is completely fine, and you can do that from the same page.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:244
msgid "Your recurring donation has been cancelled"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:245
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} has been cancelled. No further charges will be made.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for the donations you made along the way.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:252
msgid "Your recurring donation amount has changed"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:253
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your recurring donation to {campaign_title} has been changed from {old_amount} to {amount}, starting with your next payment.\n"
"\n"
"If that is not what you expected, you can change it back or stop the donation here:\n"
"{portal_url}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:257
msgid "Your recurring donation is paused"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:258
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} has been paused. Nothing will be charged until it restarts on {resumes_at}.\n"
"\n"
"You can restart it sooner, or stop it altogether, here:\n"
"{portal_url}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:262
msgid "Your recurring donation has restarted"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:263
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} has restarted. Your next payment is due on {next_payment_at}.\n"
"\n"
"You can manage it any time here:\n"
"{portal_url}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:267
msgid "Your next donation has been skipped"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:268
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your next recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} has been skipped. Nothing will be charged this time, and the donation continues on {next_payment_at}.\n"
"\n"
"You can manage it any time here:\n"
"{portal_url}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:272
msgid "Your sign-in link for {organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/SettingsService.php:273
msgid ""
"Hi {donor_name},\n"
"\n"
"Open your donor portal:\n"
"{portal_url}\n"
"\n"
"This link works for 30 days. If you didn't request it, you can ignore this email.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

